<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Defs_L3_2_1_3" targetNamespace="https://teck.example/process-models/pillar-02">
  <bpmn:collaboration id="Collab_L3_2_1_3">
    <bpmn:participant id="Pool_L3_2_1_3" name="2.1.3 Charging &amp; Stemming" processRef="Process_L3_2_1_3"/>
  </bpmn:collaboration>
  <bpmn:process id="Process_L3_2_1_3" isExecutable="false">
    <bpmn:documentation>L0/L3 Process. Explosives are loaded into drilled holes according to the approved design, followed by stemming. Explosive truck (bulk delivery vehicle) is dispatched via FMS. Quantities loaded per hole constitute the data record for explosive consumption and compliance.</bpmn:documentation>
    <bpmn:laneSet id="LaneSet_L3_2_1_3">
      <bpmn:lane id="Lane_L3_2_1_3_tk" name="Explosive Truck Operator">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Start_L3_2_1_3_s</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_L3_2_1_3_2_1_3_1</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
      <bpmn:lane id="Lane_L3_2_1_3_sf" name="Shot-firer">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_L3_2_1_3_2_1_3_2</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_L3_2_1_3_2_1_3_3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>Task_L3_2_1_3_2_1_3_4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>End_L3_2_1_3_e</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
    </bpmn:laneSet>
    <bpmn:startEvent id="Start_L3_2_1_3_s" name="Holes accepted; truck available">
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_2_1_3_1</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:startEvent>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_L3_2_1_3_2_1_3_1" name="2.1.3.1 Dispatch Explosive Truck to Pattern">
      <bpmn:documentation>FMS or operator dispatches the bulk explosive delivery vehicle (emulsion truck or ANFO truck) to the blast pattern location. Vehicle travel constitutes Non-Productive Time (NP) per GMG TUM (non-primary function transit). Truck GPS position is tracked by FMS throughout.
ISA-95 level: 2 / 3
Actors: Explosive Truck Operator; Shot-firer
Standard alignment: GMG TUM (NP — transit); GMG Mobile Equipment Open Data
DDVC layer: Raw</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_2_1_3_1</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_2_1_3_2</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_L3_2_1_3_2_1_3_2" name="2.1.3.2 Load Explosive into Holes">
      <bpmn:documentation>Shot-firer directs explosive truck operator to pump or pour bulk explosive product into each hole to the specified column height. For holes with water, emulsion product is used (water-resistant). Explosive mass loaded per hole is recorded by the truck's on-board metering system (flow meter or volumetric pump counter). For electronic detonator systems, each hole detonator is programmed with its assigned delay time and unique identifier.
ISA-95 level: 0
Actors: Shot-firer; Explosive Truck Operator
Standard alignment: ISA-95 Level 0; AMIRA P754 Principle 1 (mass measurement)
DDVC layer: Raw</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_2_1_3_2</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_2_1_3_3</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_L3_2_1_3_2_1_3_3" name="2.1.3.3 Apply Stemming">
      <bpmn:documentation>After explosive column is loaded, shot-firer fills the stemming column above the explosive with crushed aggregate or drill cuttings to contain the explosion energy. Stemming depth is verified against design.
ISA-95 level: 0
Actors: Shot-firer
Standard alignment: ISA-95 Level 0
DDVC layer: Raw</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_2_1_3_3</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_2_1_3_4</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:task id="Task_L3_2_1_3_2_1_3_4" name="2.1.3.4 Install Initiation System">
      <bpmn:documentation>Shot-firer installs the surface initiation network: detonating cord or shock tube trunklines connecting individual hole initiators (detonators) in the designed delay sequence, or programs electronic detonators if using an electronic blasting system (EBS). Network topology is documented in the blast design software. Initiation point (booster location and in-hole delay time) is recorded per hole.
ISA-95 level: 0
Actors: Shot-firer
Standard alignment: ISA-95 Level 0
DDVC layer: Raw</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_2_1_3_4</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_L3_2_1_3_5</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:task>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="End_L3_2_1_3_e" name="Initiation network assembled">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_L3_2_1_3_5</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_2_1_3_1" sourceRef="Start_L3_2_1_3_s" targetRef="Task_L3_2_1_3_2_1_3_1"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_2_1_3_2" sourceRef="Task_L3_2_1_3_2_1_3_1" targetRef="Task_L3_2_1_3_2_1_3_2"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_2_1_3_3" sourceRef="Task_L3_2_1_3_2_1_3_2" targetRef="Task_L3_2_1_3_2_1_3_3"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_2_1_3_4" sourceRef="Task_L3_2_1_3_2_1_3_3" targetRef="Task_L3_2_1_3_2_1_3_4"/>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="Flow_L3_2_1_3_5" sourceRef="Task_L3_2_1_3_2_1_3_4" targetRef="End_L3_2_1_3_e"/>
  </bpmn:process>
  <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="Diagram_L3_2_1_3">
    <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="Plane_L3_2_1_3" bpmnElement="Collab_L3_2_1_3">
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Pool_L3_2_1_3_di" bpmnElement="Pool_L3_2_1_3" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="20" y="20" width="1086" height="400"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Lane_L3_2_1_3_tk_di" bpmnElement="Lane_L3_2_1_3_tk" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="60" y="20" width="1046" height="200"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Lane_L3_2_1_3_sf_di" bpmnElement="Lane_L3_2_1_3_sf" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="60" y="220" width="1046" height="200"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Start_L3_2_1_3_s_di" bpmnElement="Start_L3_2_1_3_s"><dc:Bounds x="110" y="87" width="56" height="56"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="88" y="149" width="100" height="56"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_L3_2_1_3_2_1_3_1_di" bpmnElement="Task_L3_2_1_3_2_1_3_1"><dc:Bounds x="202" y="75" width="170" height="80"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_L3_2_1_3_2_1_3_2_di" bpmnElement="Task_L3_2_1_3_2_1_3_2"><dc:Bounds x="408" y="275" width="170" height="80"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_L3_2_1_3_2_1_3_3_di" bpmnElement="Task_L3_2_1_3_2_1_3_3"><dc:Bounds x="614" y="275" width="170" height="80"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="Task_L3_2_1_3_2_1_3_4_di" bpmnElement="Task_L3_2_1_3_2_1_3_4"><dc:Bounds x="820" y="275" width="170" height="80"/></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="End_L3_2_1_3_e_di" bpmnElement="End_L3_2_1_3_e"><dc:Bounds x="1026" y="287" width="56" height="56"/><bpmndi:BPMNLabel><dc:Bounds x="1004" y="349" width="100" height="42"/></bpmndi:BPMNLabel></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_2_1_3_1_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_2_1_3_1"><di:waypoint x="166" y="115"/><di:waypoint x="202" y="115"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_2_1_3_2_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_2_1_3_2"><di:waypoint x="372" y="115"/><di:waypoint x="390" y="115"/><di:waypoint x="390" y="315"/><di:waypoint x="408" y="315"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_2_1_3_3_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_2_1_3_3"><di:waypoint x="578" y="315"/><di:waypoint x="614" y="315"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_2_1_3_4_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_2_1_3_4"><di:waypoint x="784" y="315"/><di:waypoint x="820" y="315"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
      <bpmndi:BPMNEdge id="Flow_L3_2_1_3_5_di" bpmnElement="Flow_L3_2_1_3_5"><di:waypoint x="990" y="315"/><di:waypoint x="1026" y="315"/></bpmndi:BPMNEdge>
    </bpmndi:BPMNPlane>
  </bpmndi:BPMNDiagram>
</bpmn:definitions>
